:: kavya_clutch_d3
First attempt: you release the clutch too fast. The bike lurches, front wheel lifting an inch   a micro-wheelie. Arjun's flat stomach launches into your throat. The adrenaline spike is different in this body: sharper, centred in the chest not the gut. The testicles attempt to migrate upward, a reflexive retraction you feel distinctly and file under //male biology, subcategory: surprising//.

Second attempt: easier. The clutch point is higher than a scooty's   more resistance, more power, and Arjun's wrist is stronger, the forearm managing the throttle with torque your wrists never had. You roll it gently. The bike moves.

<<run setup.flag("ride_complete_d3")>>
