:: kavya_sees_arjun_face
<<img "pg_room_kavya_pov.png" "the scratched mirror">>
Wheat skin. Two days of stubble you'll have to deal with. Dark circles   his, from six months of pining, not yours. Long lashes Rohit apparently mocks him for.

You try Arjun's relaxed half-smile and your face does it wrong   too controlled, too precise. A dancer's posture in a swimmer's body. You'll have to loosen everything. Slouch. Take up space like you own it.

The eyes, though. Meera would say the eyes are still you. You lean in and look. Maybe. Sharp where his are soft.

<<run setup.discover("your own borrowed face", "kavya")>>
